'''Ripjaws''' is the [[Omnitrix]]'s DNA sample of a [[Piscciss Volann (Classic)|Piscciss Volann]]<ref>[[Pierce Wheels]]</ref><ref>''[[Plumbers' Helpers (Episode)|Plumbers' Helpers]]''</ref> from the planet [[Piscciss]].<ref name="Deep">''[[Deep]]''</ref>

==Appearance==
===Ben as Ripjaws===
Ripjaws shares a number of traits with [[Earth (Classic)|Earth]]'s aquatic life, such as an [[Wikipedia:Alligator|alligator]], an [[Wikipedia:Eel|eel]], a [[Wikipedia:Leech|leech]],{{Refn|[[:File:Ripjaws Bandai Lenticular Card.png]]|group = Bandai|name = bandai}} an [[Wikipedia:Anglerfish|anglerfish]], and a [[Wikipedia:Shark|shark]]. He can change between a fishtail with triangular lines or legs at will and has a phosphorescent light on his head.

In the '''[[Ben 10 (2005 TV Series)|Original Series]]''', Ripjaws' body was a pale grey. He has purplish/pinkish gray eyes attached to swamp green bases. He had webbed digits; four on his hands and two on his feet, the former of which hosted yellow claws. He sported gills going down his neck and torso, as well as patches of scales all over his body. On his arms and atop his neck were short swamp green fins. The stem of the angler sprouting from his head appeared the same color as his webbing. His circular eyes appeared vapid and he entirely lacked lips to hide away his surly teeth. When not forming a fish-like tail, he had a loincloth, segmented by off-white lines. The [[Omnitrix (Original)|original Omnitrix]] symbol was located on his left pectoral, which had a black patch covering it.

In ''[[Back With a Vengeance]]'', Ripjaws wore a yellow raincoat.

In '''[[Ben 10: Ultimate Alien (TV Series)|Ultimate Alien]]''', Ripjaws had a catfish-like face, green eyes with black pupils, two whiskers, a white torso with chest plates similar to [[Humungousaur (Classic)|Humungosaur]], three-fingered hands with black claws, a green lure, and green lips. His tail was colored grey like his skin and his fins were a darker shade of green than in the '''Original Series'''. He wore the [[Ultimatrix (Original)|Ultimatrix]] symbol on his chest.

In the '''Ultimate Alien''' intro, Ripjaws looked almost the same as in the series proper except his tail was black, reflecting his appearance in the '''Original Series'''. His lips were also colored black and his lure was white.

In ''[[Ben 10-Generator Rex: Heroes United|Heroes United]]'', Ripjaws looked mostly the same as in '''Ultimate Alien''' except one of his eyes was pink due to a coloring error.

In '''[[Ben 10: Omniverse (TV Series)|Omniverse]]''', 16-year-old Ripjaws mostly resembles his original appearance, except that his eyes are green. He now has arm and neck braces. His antenna light is green. He has a big fin on his back. The fins on his arms are longer and he is now hunched back. His claws are black, and his tail is bigger and drags behind him. He now has a belt in place of the strap that holds the [[Omnitrix (Omniverse)|Omnitrix]] symbol on it.

11-year-old Ripjaws appears almost exactly the same as he did in the '''Original Series''', except his eyes and the Omnitrix symbol on his left upper torso are recolored green.

=== Kevin as Ripjaws===
[[Kevin Levin (Classic)|Kevin]]'s Ripjaws looked the exact same as Ben's did in the '''Original Series''', but without an Omnitrix symbol. His black patch was also on his right upper torso.

