==Powers and Abilities==
<gallery type="slideshow">
Ripjaws's bite.png|Enhanced Bite Force/Sharp Teeth
Galactic Monsters Op (26).png|Mouth Expansion
GF (138).png|Tail Formation
GF (147).png|Enhanced Swimming (via Tail Formation)/Underwater Breathing
BoB (143).png|Underwater Vortex Generation (via Enhanced Swimming)
Lurk (437).png|Sharp Claws
GF (169).png|Enhanced Strength
TBoMB (130).png|Enhanced Durability
GF (157).png|Enhanced Reflexes
GF (78).png|Enhanced Stomach Capacity
Sleepaway Camper (30).png|Glowing Lure
Laugh (11).png|Glowing Eyes
</gallery>
Ripjaws' large jaws and sharp teeth are his most deadly weapon, being able to slice through steel.<ref name="GF">''[[Gone Fishin']]''</ref><ref>[[Patelliday]]</ref> His jaw can also unhinge,{{Refn|[[:File:Piscciss Is Artificial.png]]|group = DM}} allowing him to fit a large supply of objects in both his mouth and stomach.<ref name="TK" /><ref name="GF" />

Ripjaws' body is built for the sea, as he exclusively breathes in water and can withstand the pressures of the furthest depths of [[Piscciss]].<ref name="Deep"/> Ripjaws possesses the distinctive ability to turn his legs into a fish's tail, giving himself a merman-like appearance, and vice-versa. When his tail retracts, it takes the shape of a double-sided loincloth with a similar pattern to the tail's. Utilizing this power in underwater environments, Ripjaws can swim at incredible speeds with amazing agility.<ref name="TK" /> He can swim at such high speeds that he can create a vortex underwater.<ref name="TBoMB" />

Ripjaws possesses sharp claws that can slice through the metal of [[Cyber Squid]]s<ref>''[[They Lurk Below]]''</ref> and scrape solid rock.<ref name="SC">''[[Secrets]]''</ref>

Ripjaws has enhanced strength, as he was able to easily punch a hole in a dock;<ref name="TK">''[[The Krakken]]''</ref><ref name="LL">''[[Last Laugh]]''</ref> tear a door of the [[Perplexahedron]] open;<ref>''[[Perplexahedron (Episode)|Perplexahedron]]''</ref> slam a [[Mechaneer]] into the ground hard enough to rock a nearby shipwreck; lasso an anchor;<ref name="GF" /> and hold his own against [[Vulkanus]] while underwater.<ref name="TBoMB">''[[The Ballad of Mr. Baumann]]''</ref> He also has tremendous strength in his jaws alone, able to hold up a [[Human (Classic)|human]] in them.<ref name="LL"/>

Ripjaws is rather durable, as shown when he was able to withstand being thrown against [[Sheelane]]'s ship.<ref name="TBoMB" />

Like an anglerfish, he has a phosphorescent lure on his forehead for attracting prey, but it can also be used to illuminate dark areas.<ref>''[[Sleepaway Camper]]''</ref> His eyes can glow as well.<ref name="LL" />
