==Trivia==
*Ripjaws is the only alien to appear in '''[[Ben 10: Ultimate Alien (TV Series)|Ultimate Alien]]''' outside of the opening that does not have a speaking role.
*Ripjaws never received a water respirator similar to the one worn by the [[Piscciss Volann Prisoner (Classic)|Piscciss Volann Prisoner]] during his appearances in the '''[[Ben 10 (2005 TV Series)|Original Series]]''' because he was never meant to be used outside of water.{{Refn|[[:File:Ripjaws Was Never Meant to Be Used Outside of Water.png]]|group = DJW}}
**In spite of this, in the '''Original Series''', he tended to appear outside of water and get dehydrated.
*11-year-old Ripjaws was not necessarily planned to appear in '''[[Ben 10: Omniverse (TV Series)|Omniverse]]''' flashbacks.{{Refn|[[:File:OV Young Ben Aliens From Intro.png]]|group = DJW}}
*Ripjaws was first envisioned as a purple crocodile-like creature under the name [[Ben 10 (2005 TV Series)/Early Development#Razorjaws|Razorjaws]]. [[Dave Johnson]] designed his finalized sketch but had many regrets, noting the weird head shape and numerous teeth in place of lips made it difficult for animators to draw and resulted in him having few appearances.{{Refn|[[:File:Dave Johnson Ripjaws Complaints.png]]|group = DJ}}
**Dave's problem with Ripjaws' original design was that he thought not having lips made it harder for Ripjaws to emote. He also believed that his eyes were "dead".{{Refn|[[:File:Dave's Problem with Ripjaws.PNG]]|group = DJ}}
*Ripjaws' '''Ultimate Alien''' design was created by [[Glenn Wong]].{{Refn|[[:File:UA Ripjaws was designed by Glenn Wong.png]]|group = TJC}}
*Ripjaws is one of [[Duncan Rouleau]]'s favorite aliens.{{Refn|[[:File:Duncan is a Ripjaws fanboy.png]]|group = DR}}

